{"id":"en_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1","title":"BitterSweet - A Gangster Story: Part 1","titleEn":"BitterSweet - A Gangster Story: Part 1","description":"A man finds himself pulled into a criminal world he never chose, forced to live a life that isn't the one he wanted. The only path back to what he once had runs through the very world he wants no part of. This pilot pitch sets up that central conflict, following a protagonist trapped between the life he's been pushed into and the one he's desperate to reclaim. The story centers on that tension, with no easy way out and the stakes tied directly to his freedom and identity. For those interested in following this gangster drama, Dramzio is a place where the series and its episodes can be followed.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbseq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbseq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbseq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bittersweet-a-gangster-story-part-1_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbseq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed